  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "經濟與日常生活",
    "sub_ename": "ECONOMY AND EVERYDAY LIFE",
    "describe_ch": "本課程將透過對西方經濟史的介紹，期望可以幫助學習者了解在西方經濟與社會發展的歷史脈絡中，人們為了日常生活所展開的一系列經濟行動，而這些經濟活動又是如何促進了西方的經濟發展。",
    "describe_eh": "Through an introduction to the economic history of the West, this program is expected to help students understand the series of economic activities that people have carried out for their everyday life in the west economic history and social development, and how these economic activities have promoted the economic development of the West.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 2.0
  },
