    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "因應氣候變遷與永續發展的知識探索",
      "describe_en": "knowledge discovery in response to climate change and sustainable development"
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "開展全球歷史地理宏觀視野的價值判斷",
      "describe_en": "value judgement in macroscopic vision of global history and geography."
    }
